		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Omni-Tool</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — Reconfigure your tools into any set you need.</em></p><p><strong>Cast Time: 1 minute.</strong> You transform your tool set into a different one.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> The first check you make with these new tools has a +5 bonus.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You always have the last tool set you created.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Add +5 to the first check with the new tools.</em></p>",
